            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We consider the cubic fourth order nonlinear Schrödinger equation on the circle. In particular, we prove that the mean-zero Gaussian measures on Sobolev spaces [Formula: see text], [Formula: see text], are quasi-invariant under the flow.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
